nderline underline-offset-4\",\"children\":\"Site methodology\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/about\",\"className\":\"text-emerald-800 underline underline-offset-4\",\"children\":\"About Green Engineering Tools\"}]]}]]}]\n5:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Why product coverage matters for blown insulation\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"Why product coverage matters for blown insulation\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-slate mt-4 max-w-none text-slate-700\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Loose-fill products are installed to specified coverage and depth at a particular density. A bag count derived from one generic density can be wrong for another product. This calculator therefore gives the thermal thickness and volume independently, then lets the selected product's coverage or package mass drive the purchase count.\"}]}]]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Settled depth versus installed depth\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"Settled depth versus installed depth\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-slate mt-4 max-w-none text-slate-700\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Settlement behavior depends on the product and installation method. The ordering/installation allowance is editable rather than hard-coded. Use the manufacturer's coverage chart and installed/settled depth instructions where those values are provided.\"}]}]]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Use the result as a planning quantity, not an installation certificate\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"Use the result as a planning quantity, not an installation certificate\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-slate mt-4 max-w-none text-slate-700\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Actual installed performance can be affected by uneven depth, wind washing, compression, moisture, obstructions and air leakage. Inspect the completed installation and follow product and local safety requirements.\"}]}]]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"How many bags of blown-in insulation do I need?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-black text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"How many bags of blown-in insulation do I need?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\",\"children\":\"Enter the area, existing and target R-values, product thermal value and either the product's coverage per bag or installed density plus package mass. The calculator rounds package quantities up to whole units.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Does cellulose always settle by the same percentage?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-black text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Does cellulose always settle by the same percentage?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\",\"children\":\"No. Settlement and installed density are product- and application-specific. Use the product's coverage chart or installation instructions rather than assuming one universal percentage.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can the calculator handle existing insulation?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-black text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Can the calculator handle existing insulation?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\",\"children\":\"Yes. Enter the existing R-value/RSI and the desired total target. Only the shortfall is used to calculate additional thickness.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can I calculate cost?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-black text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Can I calculate cost?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\",\"children\":\"Yes. Once a package count is available, enter the local package price and a currency label to obtain a simple material-cost estimate.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 p-5 text-slate-200\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-black text-white\",\"children\":\"Related Green Engineering Tools\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/epd-carbon-calculator\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold hover:bg-white/15\",\"children\":\"EPD Carbon Calculator →\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold hover:bg-white/15\",\"children\":\"Embodied Carbon Calculator →\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/electrical\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold hover:bg-white/15\",\"children\":\"Electrical Engineering Tools →\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold hover:bg-white/15\",\"children\":\"Solar System Calculator ↗\"}]]}]]}]\na:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2qm4q1zl28dg6.js\",\"async\":true}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$18\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@1